## Database rules (applies to /src/lib/db/)
- Always use postgres parameterised queries: $1, $2 etc.
- Query smart_money_summary MV — never fund_holdings directly
- Query ipo_gmp_daily MV — never ipo_gmp directly
- All DB functions must return typed interfaces (no `any`)
- Log failed queries to data_quality_issues table
- Never SELECT * — always name columns explicitly